  <h3>Canonical in Muzeum</h3>
  <dl>
    <% rows.each do |label, entries, status| %>
      <div>
        <dt><span class="review-catalog-mark<%= " present" if entries.any? %>" aria-hidden="true"><%= entries.any? ? "✓" : "—" %></span><%= label %></dt>
        <dd><% if entries.any? %><%= safe_join(entries.map { |entry| catalog_link(entry) }, ", ") %><% else %><%= status || "No verified catalog match" %><% end %></dd>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </dl>
  <p class="compact-meta">Resolution <%= rows[1][1].any? ? "reuses the existing recording" : "creates a catalog entry for this recording" %> and applies it to this matching group.
    The original Last.fm release text is preserved. The edition played stays unverified.
    <% if rows[2][1].empty? %>Muzeum checks supported release memberships automatically. Uncertain memberships stay pending.<% end %></p>
